    13	//! all CEX-S2-10..18 Runtime task cards are gated on **CP-4** (Step 1 single-
    14	//! agent gate). Step 1 is currently incomplete (multiple `未开始` cards in the
    15	//! milestone index). This file ships the schema scaffold ahead of CP-4 by
    16	//! explicit user request to unblock parallel design work; production wiring
    17	//! must wait for Step 1 to finish. The feature gate keeps the violation
    18	//! invisible to default builds.
    19	//!
    20	//! # Schema-ownership notes
    21	//!
    22	//! - `AgentEvidence` (in `evidence.rs`) **wraps** the persistent
    23	//!   `git_internal::internal::object::evidence::Evidence` Snapshot rather than
    24	//!   forking a parallel schema. The wrapper adds the raw-fact-chain fields
