    26	//!   touch the runtime `EvidenceKind` enum here.
    27	//! - `AgentTask` / `AgentRun` / `AgentPatchSet` reference (not copy) the
    28	//!   existing `IntentSpec` / `Plan` / `Task` / `Run` / `PatchSet` Snapshots
    29	//!   from `git-internal`.
    30	//! - `MergeDecision` event payload starts as `MergeDecisionPayloadV0` stub;
