    35	//!   this scaffold; types here implement only `Serialize` + `Deserialize` and
    36	//!   will pick up the trait bound when CEX-00.5 lands.
    37	//!
    38	//! # Unknown-event-safe pattern
    39	//!
    40	//! Two layers, satisfying S2-INV-10:
    41	//! - `AgentRunEvent` uses `#[serde(tag = "kind", content = "payload")]` for
    42	//!   the recognized variants.
    43	//! - `AgentRunEventEnvelope` is the wire-level wrapper readers should parse;
    44	//!   it is `#[serde(untagged)]` over `Known(AgentRunEvent)` and
    45	//!   `Unknown(Value)` so unknown future tags fall through cleanly without
    46	//!   losing the raw payload.
    47	//!
    48	//! This is the canonical pattern CEX-00.5 will lift to the `Event` trait.
    49	//! `#[serde(other)]` on the inner enum cannot do this on its own because
    50	//! future variants will carry payloads (maps), and `#[serde(other)]` requires
