     2	//!
     3	//! Every sub-agent lifecycle event — including the
     4	//! `workspace_materialized` event a workspace materialization emits —
     5	//! is written to a **per-run** JSONL transcript at
     6	//! `.libra/sessions/{thread_id}/agents/{run_id}.jsonl`, *not* the main
