    10	//! (`docs/development/tracing/agent.md` CEX-S2-11 (3), and the `AgentRun`
    11	//! `transcript_path` contract at [`super::run::AgentRun`]).
    12	//!
    13	//! This module owns only the path resolution and the append / read I/O.
